abstract: "A single-file, parallel-safe personal memory system for Claude: append-only journals, one locked compiler, hybrid keyword and vector recall, contradiction-aware ADD-only updates, decay-based pruning, and adapters for Claude Code, Claude Desktop and claude.ai exports. Acknowledges AI collaboration by theonlymuffinbot using Anthropic Claude."
